  "reasoning": "The claim was denied with CO-97 (bundled service), which is a final adjudication and not an information request or a medical-necessity denial that can be appealed or resolved via peer-to-peer. Since the payer has determined the service is not separately payable, the contractual patient responsibility (the full allowed amount, as the deductible equals the balance) must be collected from the patient. Resubmitting would violate the duplicate claim rule, and no other action can progress the claim to payment.",
